 *   TCS34725 SDA -> GPIO2 (I2C bus 1 SDA)
 *   TCS34725 SCL -> GPIO3 (I2C bus 1 SCL)
 *   TCS34725 VDD -> 3.3 V
 *   TCS34725 GND -> GND
 *
 * Build:
 *   gcc -O2 -Wall -Wextra -o tcs34725_logger tcs34725_logger.c -lgpiod
