 *   MAX30102 SCL -> GPIO3 (I2C bus 1 SCL)
 *   MAX30102 VDD -> 3.3 V
 *   MAX30102 GND -> GND
 *
 * Build: gcc -O2 -Wall -o max30102_monitor max30102_monitor.c
