/*
 * Flame Detection Safety System — Raspberry Pi 3 Model B+
 *
 * Hardware:
 *   - Keyes KY-026 flame sensor digital output (active-low)
 *     -> DO  -> GPIO17 (BCM, physical pin 11)
 *   - Active buzzer
 *     -> +   -> GPIO18 (BCM, physical pin 12)
 *     -> -   -> GND
 *
 * Behavior:
 *   - Polls the flame sensor every 500 ms.
 *   - Breaks the 2 s buzzer activation into 100 ms slices so it
 *     responds promptly to shutdown signals.
 *   - Logs "FLAME DETECTED" entries to alert_log.txt on HIGH-to-LOW
 *     transitions (LOW = flame detected).
 *   - Logs "System started" and "System stopped" entries on startup and
 *     shutdown.
 *   - Cleanly exits on SIGINT / SIGTERM.
